nk-0 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-text-muted","children":"—"}],"Reactions, mentions, and pins work the way you expect."]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-text-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-text-muted","children":"—"}],"Markdown everywhere: code blocks, inline code, quotes, and links."]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-text-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.8] text-text-muted","children":"—"}],"Edit and delete events are synchronized through the current realtime layer."]}]]}],["$","h2","3",{"className":"mt-6 border-t border-border pt-8 text-[22px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.01em] text-text-primary","children":"Realtime by design"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-text-secondary","children":"Messaging uses Supabase Realtime Broadcast and Presence. The interface renders new messages optimistically and reconciles them with server state while presence keeps the channel aware of who is connected."}],["$","h2","5",{"className":"mt-6 border-t border-border pt-8 text-[22px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.01em] text-text-primary","children":"Encryption status"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-text-secondary","children":"End-to-end encryption for direct messages is planned roadmap work and is not presented as available today. Current deployments should use the security controls provided by Supabase and their chosen infrastructure."}],["$","p","7",{"className":"border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.65] text-text-secondary","children":"Everything in messaging is available over the API — send, edit, react, and search programmatically with the same permissions as the signed-in user."}]]}]]}]}],"$L3"]}],null,"$L4"]}],"isPartial"